4-602.13 The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
1. hood filters above cooking equipment (dust);
2. foil lined drip trays at pastry stove (splash);
3. walkin cooler shelving (general buildup); 
4. shelving in dish area (dust buildup on lower shelves);  and
5. inner surface of sprayer head at 3 part sink (general buildup).
Clean the abovementioned items. Nonfood contact surfaces shall be cleaned at a frequency necessary to eliminate buildup of grease, food splash and general debris.
